    5  * This class does almost nothing on its own: it's the object macOS's
    6  * network stack / CoreWLAN sees as "the Wi-Fi interface". All real work
    7  * happens in RTL88WiFi (the IO80211Controller). We just need to
    8  * override inputPacket() so RX frames get delivered correctly with the
    9  * 802.11-aware framing IO80211Family expects.
   10  */
   11 #pragma once
   12 

